Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, lovely, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a dear and deliver it right away. Thanks a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,She cleans at the station uptown, so if you go now...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She mops the toilets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, she'll be so happy about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And no peeking!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you must know, it's from her mother; they've never got along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now she wants to make up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple of times a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And then Elisabeth gets a letter like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I have to get him home.
